            Early decision, legacy status, and demonstrated interest can shift the odds at specific
            schools. None of these factors are reflected in a numbers-only estimate. Use this
            calculator to build a sensible list and set expectations, then invest real effort in the
            qualitative parts of each application.
          </p>
          <p>
            Law school admissions is and is not a numbers game. The numbers decide which schools are
            realistic, but the rest of your application decides whether you actually get in.
